# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` is allowed to upload to Google Cloud.
#
# Everything is kept out unless named below, so the personal data (data/), the keys (.env),
# the private notes (docs/), the Mac app and the iPhone app never leave this computer.
*

!Dockerfile
!.gcloudignore

!server/
!server/**

!src/
src/*
!src/__init__.py
!src/ledger.py
!src/plaid_sync.py
!src/enrich_transactions.py

**/__pycache__/
